  "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"content-panel studio-page\">\n                    <section class=\"studio-intro studio-section\">\n                        <div class=\"studio-copy\">\n                            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Continuous measurement</p>\n                            <h2>Move from DevOps to DevGreenOps</h2>\n                            <p>Integrate Greenspector Studio into your DevOps pipeline to validate frugality,\n                                environmental impacts and performance before each release.</p>\n                            <p>The SaaS solution and its APIs enable rapid integration into the software factory.\n                                Monitor ecoscore, CO2 impact, journey time and behaviour on\n                                older devices.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                            <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/integrationContinue-r41o4pdhzctkv1sa5vlktqqp0cmhd71xbj3ool0urc_9475d721.png\" alt=\"Continuous integration with Greenspector Studio\">\n                        </figure>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section studio-highlight\">\n                        <div class=\"studio-copy\">\n                            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Software factories</p>\n                            <h2>Integration into all your pipelines</h2>\n                            <p>Add Greenspector Studio to your software factory using the available APIs.\n                                Run a measurement before each release or after each build.</p>\n                            <p><strong>The more often you measure, the more instructive the results become</strong> and\n                                help you keep your product's frugality and impacts under control.</p>\n                            <p><a href=\"https://greenspectorstudio.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/DPP/pages/220299271/L+API+Greenspector+Studio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View API documentation</a></p>\n                        </div>\n                        <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                            <a href=\"https://greenspectorstudio.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/DPP/pages/220299271/L+API+Greenspector+Studio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Api-Swagger-r5y6z7c9iy827de2kz4bjqctq0ozymp5qw20buqq48_914331df.png\" alt=\"Greenspector Studio API Swagger documentation\">\n                            </a>\n                        </figure>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">REST API</p>\n                        <h2>Trigger tests and export results</h2>\n                        <div class=\"studio-grid\">\n                            <article class=\"studio-card studio-card-compact\">\n                                <h3>CI/CD triggering</h3>\n                                <p>Run tests from GitLab CI, Azure DevOps, Jenkins or your usual\n                                    orchestrator.</p>\n                            </article>\n                            <article class=\"studio-card studio-card-compact\">\n                                <h3>Data export</h3>\n                                <p>Feed your own dashboards with measurement results and indicators.</p>\n                            </article>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section studio-quote-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">What they say</p>\n                        <blockquote class=\"studio-quote\">\n                            <p>With Greenspector Studio, we measure the energy efficiency of our application,\n                                used by 7 million customers every month, after each build. This allows us to\n                                reduce our carbon footprint, improve our performance and strengthen our\n                                brand image.</p>\n                            <footer>\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/FLankar-150x150_9a821a87.jpg\" alt=\"Portrait of François Lankar\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <strong>François Lankar</strong>\n                                    <span>Applications Manager, Bouygues Telecom</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </footer>\n                        </blockquote>\n</section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">GreenOps</p>\n                        <h2>Track key indicators at each release</h2>\n                        <p>Measuring frequently helps avoid going live with a frugality or\n                            performance defect, and observe long-term trends.</p>\n                        <ul>\n                            <li><strong>Detect regressions</strong> before they reach users.</li>\n                            <li><strong>Track trends</strong> from one version to the next.</li>\n                            <li><strong>Align the product</strong> with the company's environmental strategy.</li>\n                        </ul>\n                        <div class=\"studio-grid\">\n                            <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/evolution-r41o1fvo92cqjsiy7yt7o2e2r6pln13h7djzozv2d4_4627dddb.png\" alt=\"Ecoscore trend across versions\">\n                            </figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                                <a href=\"https://greenspector.com/fr/comment-passer-du-devops-au-devgreenops/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                                    <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/DevGreenOps-r5y6b8gf91eu5c7gjm4sys3oeau1ohjkg969rua4s8_8b1f6600.png\" alt=\"DevOps cycle and Greenspector Studio usage in DevGreenOps\">\n                                </a>\n                            </figure>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Lifecycle</p>\n                        <h2>DevGreenOps, a natural evolution of DevOps</h2>\n                        <p>The eight phases of the DevOps loop can integrate an approach to frugality of needs and\n                            resource consumption, as well as control of the environmental quality of the\n                            software product.</p>\n                        <p>Greenspector Studio is mainly used for pre-release testing. It also\n                            lets you monitor production and occasionally validate a technical or functional choice.</p>\n                        <p>To go further, read the article <a href=\"https://greenspector.com/fr/comment-passer-du-devops-au-devgreenops/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How to move from DevOps to DevGreenOps</a>\n                            or watch the <a href=\"https://youtu.be/SugK-lRUGok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">webinar</a>.</p>\n                        <div class=\"studio-logo-grid\">\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Grafana-logo_e4bbf4d7.webp\" alt=\"Logo Grafana\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Datadog-logo-3_9d1b851c.webp\" alt=\"Logo Datadog\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Azure-logo_e63cb103.webp\" alt=\"Logo Azure\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Gitlab-logo_f2cdfd9a.webp\" alt=\"Logo GitLab\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/circle-ci-logo-1024x290_3fe789c3.webp\" alt=\"Logo CircleCI\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/jenkins-logo_610f2aab.webp\" alt=\"Logo Jenkins\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/spacelift-logo_11601252.webp\" alt=\"Logo Spacelift\"></figure>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"btn btn-gs-primary\" href=\"../../contact/\">Request a\n                                    free demo</a></p>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Standards</p>\n                        <h2>Compatible with leading standards</h2>\n                        <div class=\"studio-grid studio-mini-grid\">\n                            <article class=\"studio-card studio-card-compact\">\n                                <h3>Recognition</h3>\n                                <p>Solution recognised for its environmental efficiency.</p>\n                            </article>\n                            <article class=\"studio-card studio-card-compact\">\n                                <h3>R&amp;D</h3>\n                                <p>A methodology powered by research and international publications.</p>\n                            </article>\n                            <article class=\"studio-card studio-card-compact\">\n                                <h3>Frameworks</h3>\n                                <p>ACV ISO 14040, SCI Green Software Foundation, RCP ADEME et standards associés.</p>\n                            </article>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">References</p>\n                        <h2>They use Greenspector Studio</h2>\n                        <p>To combine environmental responsibility, user satisfaction and application\n                            performance.</p>\n                        <div class=\"studio-logo-grid\">\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_sncfconnect_04f4832d.jpg\" alt=\"SNCF Connect logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_cats_8cc5042d.jpg\" alt=\"CATS logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Logo_AirFrance_616731c4.webp\" alt=\"Air France logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/logo-bouygues-telecom_889990d1.svg\" alt=\"Bouygues Telecom logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_orange_338b842b.jpg\" alt=\"Orange logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Logo-France-televisions-300x157_e988d666.jpg\" alt=\"France Télévisions logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_regionbretagne_b8829f76.jpg\" alt=\"Région Bretagne logo\"></figure>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                </div>"
